Description: PiCompose driver for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics Pi HAT (version 1)
 Device tree overlay for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics Pi HAT (version 1), which has a
 WM8960 codec. The kernel already has the driver for the codec, so the
 package only needs the overlay of Seeed that connects it to the I2S pins of
 the Raspberry Pi. It enables I2C and SPI (for the LEDs of the HAT) and loads
 the overlay in the boot configuration, and adds a profile set for the sound
 card so that the volume of the sink controls the outputs of the codec.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.

